# LAMMPS input script for Ni melting

# Initialization
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

# System Construction
lattice fcc 3.52   # lattice parameter in Angstroms as typical for bulk Ni
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.52 3.52 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (35.2 35.2 35.2)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 4000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (35.2 35.2 35.2)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

# Potential

pair_style zero 10.0
pair_coeff * *
mass 1 27

# Velocities
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

# Thermo and neighbor settings
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 5

# Thermo settings
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal

# Minimization (optional, ensure a relaxed initial structure)
minimize 1.0e-4 1.0e-6 100 1000
